@gyhyfj useAliveList() is a useState of compoables that only returns a list. This instance only controls the pages in the list to be keepalive, but once you visit other pages, all the list pages will be invalid, and you need to reload the list after the second visit to achieve the function, because each time you set to.meta.keepalive will cause all pages to become true.
you can try this example.(just only visit /a,/b,/c pages and then visit a other page)
```
export default defineNuxtRouteMiddleware((to,from)=>{
  if(['/a','/b','/c'].indexOf(to.path)>=0){
         to.meta.keepalive=true;
  }else{
      to.meta.keepalive=false;
  }
});
```

